window.products.push({"id":1166021,"name":"Onquma Ceramic Pinch Bowls - Anatolia Line and Handcrafted Ceramic Prep Small Sauce Dipping Serving Pinch Bowls - Multicolor Home, Kitchen, Coffee Tab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O3Y2evgFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ONQUMA CERAMIC PINCH BOWLS SET OF 6 Keep your ingredients close at hand like a professional chef with these pinch bowls. Onquma Natural Line Ceramic Pinch Bowl set comes with an authentic and stylish design that will make your servings more convenient and enjoyable at the table. The bowls are fragile and must be hand-washed. The food serving bowls design for stackable can save more space and make your cabinet look cleaner. Perfectly sized for a single serving. They are ideal for serving dips, salsas, dressings, sauces, candy, appetizers, snacks, and side dishes like olives, cheese, honey, and ketchup. It will be very enjoyable to serve your guests, dried fruits and nuts for breakfast, dinner, or alongside coffee. CHARMING DETAILS AND PERFECT FOR GIFT These small pinch bowls have a diameter of 3.34 inches and they are 1.57 inches tall. You can serve sauces, jams, honey, condiments, snacks, nuts, and other small-size food with them. These serving pinch bowls will not only decorate your food, table, and kitchen but also bring an appetite to your family and guests. Onquma pinch bowls are produced and painted with care in Turkey. You can use the bowls as a charcuterie accessory, use them as a prep bowl, or as a decorative bowl set. These serving bowls are great little birthday gifts, Christmas gifts, holiday gifts, and housewarming gifts, and people love them and they are authentic. You can even gift them to your loved ones and friends. IMPORTANT NOTE The objects and foods shown in the pictures are not included in the package. They are used just for display purposes. Do not hesitate, simply click “ADD TO CART” to order yours today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O3Y2evgFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Onquma","source_asin":"B09HZ6P3VL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1166021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HZ6P3VL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HZ6P3VL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1166022,"name":"Brew Now KOMBUCHA KAMP MUSHROOM KIT (incl. 1 LRG SCOBY + 1 Cup Start Liquid & Complete pdf Handbook)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Rs0q-im5L.jpg","description":"The Kombucha Mamma Brew Now Kombucha Mushroom Kit (includes 1 Large SCOBY plus 1 Cup Strong Starter Liquid - Makes 1 Gallon) - This Product Features: 1 SCOBY Kombucha Culture, Strong Starter Liquid with yeast strands (1 Cup), Hannah's Special Tea Blend For Perfect Kombucha (30 servings), Reusable muslin tea bags, Organic evaporated cane juice sugar, Upcycled Cotton Cloth Cover & Rubber Band, Complete Kombucha Handbook (100+ page e-book), Web support (Facebook, KommUnity, Forums). ***Kombucha Kamp SCOBY Cultures are the highest quality starter you can buy to make fresh Kombucha at home for about ten cents a glass. KKamp SCOBYs are guaranteed to brew and provide superior flavor and brewing development over competitors. Not all SCOBYs are created equal. There are many low quality SCOBYs being sold. WARNING: Don't be tricked into ordering these types of inferior cultures: dehydrated (requires 30 days to brew), pint sized cultures (weak brew, slow brew), or even test tube cultures (mold). Your brand new KKamp SCOBY Cultures are full sized (5-6\" across) and shipped with over a cup each of strong starter liquid and healthy yeast strands. Not only that, KKamp SCOBYs are raised on 100% Organic and Fair Trade Ingredients for maximum health of the culture and you! Even if you've been brewing for years, you will be surprised and excited by the flavor of your new Kombucha with these healthy cultures. Each Culture makes 1 gallon of delicious, sparkling Kombucha and will reproduce to create a lifetime of Kombucha if properly cared for. HANNAH'S SPECIAL TEA BLEND FOR PERFECT KOMBUCHA - Serious tea drinkers know that it starts and ends with the quality in the leaves. My signature blend features organic white, green and black tea, rooibos and yerba mate for added flavor and health benefits. All organic and fair trade. This package ships via USPS Priority Mail Service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Rs0q-im5L.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kombucha Kamp","source_asin":"B008OHXYCC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1166022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008OHXYCC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008OHXYCC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
