window.products.push({"id":1166199,"name":"Kare & Kind 40-inch Number 2 (Digit) Aluminum Foil Balloon - Big Size Metallic Rainbow Colored Party Decoration Supplies - Air or Helium Filled","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810wagsNMbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"40 INCH REUSABLE NUMBER BALLOON >> Brighten up your parties with some colorful decorations. The pack contains 1 piece of 2 (digit) number rainbow-colored balloon that is 40 inches (101.6cm) in size. The popular party decor is large enough to be visible on huge party venues. ALUMINUM FOIL PARTY DECORATION >> The high-quality aluminum foil material gives the balloons a smooth and bright finish. The metallic surface makes it sparkly and beautiful to look at. The large size and color with a beautiful color scheme can be mixed and matched with party banners and other party decorations. OPTION TO FILL WITH AIR OR HELIUM >> Use a helium tank or an air pump to inflate the foil balloons. The helium-filled balloons can float from 3-5 days. Hang the air-filled balloon using a string or mount it with tape to walls, ceilings, windows and strategic locations. EASY TO INFLATE AND SELF SEALING >> Simply insert a straw into the small opening at the bottom of the balloon and start inflating until you get the desired fit. Once done, draw the straw out and pinch the opening to seal. Save a lot of money, deflate the balloons and keep it for another occasion. PERFECT FOR MULTIPLE OCCASIONS >> Digit (number) foil balloons are perfect for numerous events.Great to use for photoshoots, birthday celebrations, unicorn-themed parties, graduation, anniversaries, New Year. The metallic rainbow-colored balloon can be used to decorate events for both genders, kids, teens, men, women and the elderly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810wagsNMbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kare & Kind","source_asin":"B096VNTD5S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1166199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096VNTD5S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096VNTD5S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
