window.products.push({"id":1166206,"name":"Disney Minnie Mouse XOXO Kids 3 Piece Storage Set Includes Plush Throw, Pillow, & Collapsible Storage Bin (Official Disney Product)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fK2F8QRvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring the magic of Disney to life with with this Disney Minnie Mouse three piece storage set. Storage set includes (1) 14 x 14 inch plush decorative throw pillow, (1) 40 x 50 inch plush microfiber throw, and (1) 13 x 13 inch collapsible storage bin. The perfect gift and organizational tool for any young Minnie Mouse fan, the storage set is made to fit almost any cubby hole or shelving unit. Use the storage bin for toys, shoes, crafts and so much more! The box collapses flat for easy storage when not in use. Use the pillow and throw at night or during nap time while cuddling on the couch or in bed. Made from 100% plush polyester this storage box set is fade resistant. To clean blanket, machine wash cold. To dry, air/tumble dry on low. To clean pillow and storage bin, spot clean only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fK2F8QRvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jay Franco","source_asin":"B07FXXZ9J3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1166206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FXXZ9J3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FXXZ9J3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1166207,"name":"Defrosting Tray | Meat Thawing Board | Eco Friendly Defrost | Food Safe Aluminum - Fast Fresh Healthy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IM4D1U+9L._AC_SL1160_.jpg","description":"✔️Defrost your meat, and frozen foods in much less time! Save the stress of having to decide what to eat a day in advance, as it used to take hours to defrost your dinner. Now, with the Defrosting Tray, meat can take as fast as 30 mins to 1 hour, depending on the thickness of meat. Save at least half the time, going Fast Fresh and Healthy! Whether you have forgotten to thaw your food, or you want to speed up the process, just place it on the tray, and let it defrost! Patented dishwasher, food safe aluminum uses thermal conduction to quickly and naturally transfer warmth evenly across the surface of food☛defrosting the food in the most natural and healthy way while locking in all the natural juices and nutrients! (29.5x20.8x0.2cm/11.6\"x8.2\"x0.1\")✔️","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IM4D1U+9L._AC_SL1160_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAFEWERX","source_asin":"B085HMVQRM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1166207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085HMVQRM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085HMVQRM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1166208,"name":"Wekity Toothbrush Holder Wall Mounted, Multi-Functional Toothbrush and Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser for Bathroom, with Cups, Grey Toothbrush Holder ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zEdWhr9TL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"WEKITY Multi-functional Wall-mounted Toothpaste and Toothbrush Holder WEKITY Toothpaste Dispenser and Toothpaste Squeezer Kit are made from Environment-friendly silicone, harmless to toothpaste tube.  Easy to install the dispenser and the holder on our wall.  Non-nail design won't damage the wall.  Hygienic &Economy - Pump every drop toothpaste in tube Keeps everything nice and neat. Package Include: 1x Toothbrush Holder with 1 cup or 2 cups  1x Toothpaste Dispenser 1x Adhesive Strip (The toothbrushes, toothpaste and other items on toothbrush holder are not included) Very Important: Always make sure the toothpaste is tightly screwed into the toothpaste squeezer inlet.  Only it's seal connected, it will work very well.  Please push the rod of toothpaste dispenser for 3-5 times to squeeze the air out for the first time to use. NO NEED TO PUNCH HOLES The product is attached with no trace stickers, suction wall type suspension, protect the wall without leaving traces, save your Bathroom space. Steps of installation: Clean the wall and make the surface dry.  Tearing off the super indentation glue film.  Installation of super indentation.  Press the film Install the assembled object onto the adhesive without sticking. Once it sticks to the surface, it will not fall off easily. Note: Applicable wall: smooth tile, wooden wall, smooth marble, smooth glass, frosted glass, smooth metal. Not applicable wall: wallpaper, lime wall, paint wall.  If the toothbrush holder fall off due to incorrect installation, please contact us and we will send you a new seamless adhesive.  Hope you can enjoy the convenience it brings to you by the multifunctional wall-mounted toothbrush holder. Any problem pls feel free to contact us. We promise 12-hour Response Time for Customer Issues","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zEdWhr9TL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wekity","source_asin":"B08DQZJR7C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1166208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DQZJR7C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DQZJR7C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
