window.products.push({"id":1166248,"name":"Humidifiers for Bedroom, 3.5L Top Fill Cool Mist Humidifiers with Filter, Quiet Humidifiers with Adjustable Mist Output & 360° Rotation Nozzle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ygFJnIbsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3.5L LARGE CAPACITY - Do you feel your skin and throat are dry in dry weather? Susenc humidifiers for large room is an excellent choice for you to effectively relieve dry skin/eyes/throat, coughing, congestion, stuffy nose, allergies. 3.5 L/0.9 Gal large-capacity humidifier for large room(max 200ml/h), It can work continuously for more than 30 hrs at lowest amount of mist. 28dB whisper-quiet ultrasonic humidifiers for home will work for you silently, creating a comfortable environment for you. EASY CLEAN & REFILL - Susenc integrated top fill humidifiers solve the problem of refilling water for bottom-fill humidifiers. You're no longer worried about leaks, and refilling water has never been easier. Remove the top lid and add water. Susenc top fill humidifier is easy to clean, and there is no need to worry about the problem of cleaning the scale which will affect the normal operation of the humidifier. We recommend that you clean it once 2 weeks. HUMIDIFIER & DIFFUSER 2 IN 1 - Susenc cool mist humidifier has a modern minimalist design. The rectangular design can effectively save space, which is very suitable for bedrooms, living rooms, offices, nurseries, apartments, etc. At the same time, Susenc vaporizers for bedroom can also be an essential oil diffuser - you can add essential oils into tank, and you can make your room full of fragrance while enjoying the cool mist. ADJUSTABLE MIST OUTPUT – Our air humidifier is very easy to use. you can adjust the mist output by rotating the dial knob. 360° Rotation Nozzle can help you adjust the direction of the mist. It is very convenient for the elderly and children to use Susenc cool mist humidifier. Susenc cool mist humidifier is equipped with a filter, which can filter heavy metal impurities in the water, protect your health, and extend the service life of the humidifier. AUTO SHUT-OFF PROTECTION - Susenc humidifier has automatic shut-off protection - when the water level in the tank is too low, it will auto stop working, and the knob indicator will turn red. The transparent tank helps you find the water shortage in time, and add water to make the humidifier run normally. Tips: To ensure your normal use, don't add more water than the MAX water level.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ygFJnIbsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Susenc","source_asin":"B09SYPB8S5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1166248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SYPB8S5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SYPB8S5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
