window.products.push({"id":1166421,"name":"Ice Cube Trays Silicone Set of 2, Ice Ball Maker Mold, Whiskey Ice Ball Mold, Round Ice Cube Mold, Sphere Ice Cube Mold - Square Large Ice Cube Trays ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618PXPIZMkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you like to keep your drinks cool but don’t have an ice maker, odds are you need an ice tray. It’s likely that at some point or another, all of us have owned a cheap, plastic version that snapped in half amid twisting and turning to extract at least one measly cube to chill lukewarm water. Those days are over. With our durable, easy-release ice sphere tray, you no longer have to worry about damaging your tray or compromising the integrity of the cubes inside. With no-transfer materials, you can even meal prep without worrying about today’s iced coffee tasting like last week’s baby food. Easy to fill, easy to use! This ice sphere tray creates 1.8-inch ice blocks using durable, fade-resistant silicone that lasts through many freezing cycles without becoming discolored or brittle. The silicone material makes it easy to remove as few cubes as you want at one time without a fight. Just push up on the bottom of each compartment to pop out an ice block. Some of the amazing features of this product: 🥃Top-quality silicone ice mold with lid; 🥃Beautiful effect; 🥃Durable and resistant; 🥃Food-grade and safe; 🥃Easy ice release; 🥃Perfect to add in liquor, whiskey, cocktails, iced cold coffees, lemonade; 🥃BPA-free; 🥃Safe for dishwasher, oven, freezer, microwave; 🥃Large ice balls; 🥃Non-toxic and odorless; 🥃Temperature-resistant; 🥃Can be used for baby food, popsicles, juice, creams; 🥃Non-stick surface; 🥃Easy to clean and reusable. Enjoy your favorite beverage with our round ice balls!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618PXPIZMkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BNA","source_asin":"B08P5G98YY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1166421","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P5G98YY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P5G98YY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1166422,"name":"Hunnibi Handmade Honey Jar with Dipper, Glass Made Honey Dipper and Honey Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xZsuyky8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝐒𝐄𝐑𝐕𝐄 𝐘𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝐇𝐎𝐍𝐄𝐘 𝐑𝐎𝐘𝐀𝐋𝐋𝐘 & 𝐌𝐄𝐒𝐒-𝐅𝐑𝐄𝐄! No need to use spoons, forks, or other utensils to sweeten your tea or your pancakes – and forget the rest of your honey jars too. This specially designed honey pot jar will do the trick without mess or extra effort! 𝐁𝐄𝐄-𝐀𝐔𝐓𝐈𝐅𝐔𝐋 𝐇𝐎𝐍𝐄𝐘 𝐏𝐎𝐓 𝐅𝐎𝐑 𝐘𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝐁𝐑𝐄𝐀𝐊𝐅𝐀𝐒𝐓 𝐓𝐀𝐁𝐋𝐄! Our honey jar is made of glass and has a stylish bee decor on its dipper, which means that, when you’re not using it, it makes a wonderful piece of décor for your table or countertop! 𝐆𝐋𝐀𝐒𝐒 𝐃𝐈𝐏𝐏𝐄𝐑 𝐅𝐎𝐑 𝐄𝐀𝐒𝐄 𝐎𝐅 𝐔𝐒𝐄! To make your life easier, we have also designed a glass honey dipper stick for your honey pot. Different from most honey dippers, this one allows for easily controlling the amount of honey you prefer and not a drop more! 𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐄𝐒 𝐖𝐈𝐓𝐇 𝐀 𝐋𝐈𝐃 𝐓𝐎 𝐊𝐄𝐄𝐏 𝐘𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝐇𝐎𝐍𝐄𝐘 𝐅𝐑𝐄𝐒𝐇 & 𝐘𝐔𝐌𝐌𝐘! Unlike other honey containers, the pot is covered with a tasteful glass lid that protects its content from dust, insects, or other unwanted… ingredients. And the best part? The dipper is integrated into the lid so that you won't have to look for it or wash it separately! 𝐂𝐔𝐑𝐕𝐘, 𝐒𝐓𝐘𝐋𝐈𝐒𝐇 𝐃𝐄𝐒𝐈𝐆𝐍 𝐌𝐄𝐄𝐓𝐒 𝐈𝐃𝐄𝐀𝐋 𝟏𝟒 𝐎𝐙 𝐂𝐀𝐏𝐀𝐂𝐈𝐓𝐘! - A practical honey jar with its own honey dipper stick does not have to be boring-looking. Also it should be able to drip more than those mini honey jars that serve tiny drops! That’s why we have combined a modern, minimal honey pot jar design which can also hold up to 14 oz of honey – just for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xZsuyky8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hunnibi","source_asin":"B08672K5R6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1166422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08672K5R6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08672K5R6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
