window.products.push({"id":1166541,"name":"Auto Stirring Cup, BEYOUNG Automatic Magnetic Self Stirring Coffee Cup With 3 Mixing Function, Travel Tumbler Car Cup With Wireless Shaftless Mixing S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o-y5eQfsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STRONG STIRRER POWER: This self stirring coffee cup equip with built-in 400 mAh battery. There have 3 stirring modes for you: 30s/60s/30m. \"30s\" for one stirring, \"60s\" for mixing different food like oatmeal and milk, \"30m\" for long drinking, 30s stirring then leave 10mins for drinking, this procedure circles three times under mode \"30m\" (not means keep stirring 30mins). When you want to make simple coffee breakfast, just press the switch to get a delicious coffee quickly WIRELESS MIXING CUP: The self-mixing cup adopt shaftless magnetic stir and 7.4w rated power. Charging full power just need 2.5 hours, this automatic stirring cup designed with Type-C port, packaging come with USB cable, you could take it go anywhere, charge anytime EASY TO USE: BPA free, you can use auto magnetic mug to stir coffee powder, hot cocoa, protein powder, chocolate, mocha. Comparing with hand stirring, you have to clean spoon and the powder cannot fused completely, oppositely this self-stirring cup can fully mix water and powder, easy to clean. Based on people's coffee habit, the self stirring cup just like a clock to help master re-stir coffee in time, supply best coffee-tasting service EASY TO CLEAN AND CARRY: This travel coffee cup uses detachable magnetic stirrer inside and a stainless steel liner, which is very easy to clean make you no longer worry about rinsing the cup. And if you don't need to stir, just take the magnetic stirer out, then it also could be a simple cup in daily. Meanwhile the moderate size make it easy to carry anywhere, great size to put in your car cup holder CREATIVE PRESENT: It is a good choice to give this self-stirring coffee mug as a gift for anniversaries, father day, christmas, birthdays, and holidays. It is an ideal gift for men women lover","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o-y5eQfsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beyoung","source_asin":"B0BWMRNTG6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1166541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWMRNTG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWMRNTG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
