window.products.push({"id":1166551,"name":"Zen Bamboo 1800 Series Luxury Bed Sheets - Eco-Friendly, Hypoallergenic and Wrinkle Resistant Rayon Derived from Bamboo - 4-Piece - Queen - Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71idTe87lQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sleep better than ever in the comfort and high end luxury of Bamboo Bed sheets. These sheets are high quality, durable, and soft. No itching or rough fabric against your skin. They'll fit perfectly on your mattress as well and look terrific. These organic bamboo fiber sheets are comfortable, ultra-soft and silky which ensures your body and mind get a peaceful sleep all night long. These bamboo sheets are made up of an eco-friendly organic bamboo fabric blend with microfiber, offering luxury coziness and breathability. These sheets are in high demand and sell out fast. Order yours today and sleep great in comfort and ultra high end luxury.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71idTe87lQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zen Bamboo","source_asin":"B078C622C6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1166551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078C622C6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078C622C6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1166552,"name":"Beach Vacation Accessories Essentials - Beach Sand Coasters Drink Cup Holders, Beach Trip Must Haves for Women Adults Family Friends(Multicolor, 5 Pac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611srAx1S7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size: 5.5 x 5.5 x 4 inches; Material: Durable renewable plastic Beach Vacation Must-Have: Frustrated with time-consuming assembly before you hit the beach? Keep your hands free and your drinks, snacks, and belongings sand-free with these 3.5 inch large capacity sand coasters. Place them right next to your beach chair or blanket and let the good times roll! Large Capacity for All Your Essentials: With a 3.5-inch diameter, our coasters can fit most drinks, beer, cell phones, speakers, glasses, baby bottles, earphones, sunscreen, camerasn, and more. Keep everything within easy reach without sacrificing valuable beach real estate What You See is What You Get: 5 round coasters in 5 bright colors (Purple, Carolina Blue, Lemon Green, Orange and Pink). The bright color also makes it easy to find on the beach. We all hate losing stuff at the beach! Save Space in Your Beach Bag: Our cute starfish five wrist stackable design adds a touch of fun to your beach experience. They detach easily for storage in a beach bag and are easy to assemble for use Perfect Gift for Everyone: Perfect gift for your loved ones or family and friends. Share the fun with family and friends going on vacation, hosting a party, having a picnic, or camping by the campfire. Everyone loves them! Space-saving Design: Each coaster measures 5.5 x 5.5 x 4 inches. 5 pieces stacked together are only 5.5 inches high, making them easy to pack and carry around in your beach bag Easy To Clean: They’re also very easy to clean - just rinse it by water. A friendly suggestion:-) Definitely get a set...or a few, your friends will want them once they use them! Welcome to join beach-going Pros. Don't miss out on the fun and convenience of these must-have sand coasters. Don't wait – order now and start enjoying hassle-free beach days!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611srAx1S7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uarzt","source_asin":"B0B7DP29MD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1166552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7DP29MD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7DP29MD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
