window.products.push({"id":1166736,"name":"Funny Retirement Gifts for Women 2022 - Retirement Tumbler Cup 20oz - Retired Gifts for Women - Best Retirement Gifts for Women, Coworker - Happy Reti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pUVQfOy7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Happy Retirement Gift Retiring from the workforce is always a major and monumental decision for anybody, especially after years of hard work. If a loved one has chosen that it is now time for them to get their freedom, it is important that we show them our support and offer them a present to show our love and respect for them. You must be looking for a perfect present, and this lovely and functional retirement mug tumbler will help you find the perfect answer. You can give this retirement cup to your parents, teachers, friends, bosses, and coworkers, as well as any retirees you respect. We are confident that this present will make them happy from the bottom of their hearts. Bring It Anywhere You Go Needs to travel a lot? Don't worry; we got you covered! This tumbler has the best color, design, and quality that fits anywhere you go yet still maintains the perfect condition for your favorite cold or hot drink every day! Product Features 🌟 100% BPA FREE🌟 Sweat Free🌟 Premium Quality🌟 Vacuum Insulated ⚠️ Care & usage 👉 Do not wash it in the dishwasher in case that the cup glass would be scratched👉 Wash with hand and non-scratch sponges or cloth in warm water👉 Not microwavable👉 Please do not invert the tumbler to avoid pouring👉 Keep children away from the tumbler when it is filled with hot liquid Customer satisfaction is guaranteed We guarantee our service, your satisfaction is our #1 priority, and we are committed to offering the highest quality available!Order now to get your Retirement Tumbler!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pUVQfOy7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Larura","source_asin":"B097BJQN45","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1166736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097BJQN45","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097BJQN45","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1166737,"name":"Botanica Greenery Tall Artificial Plant - Monstera deliciosa - Nearly 6 Foot Tall - Large Tropical Replica Plants for Indoor Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oEt4l4iGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Botanica Greenery artificial Monstera Deliciosa adds a unique splash of life to any room, and makes a stylish accent to any space. Flexible plant stems allow you to bend and twist them into the desired shape for its position. Dimensions: Depending on shaping, up to 70 inches (5.8 ft / 180 cm) high, and 39 inches (3.25 ft / 100 cm) wide. This plant is as large as life just like the real Monstera Deliciosa . The 13 leaves are various sizes and shades of green. As in nature, the older leaves are darker and the fresh young leaves are lighter green. Each plant is individually hand crafted . The natural leaf design looks like the REAL tropical Monstera Deliciosa leaves. The plant comes in a plain black nursery pot , just like plants bought at the garden center, and can be placed inside your own pot cover or planter box to suit your style. As a decor piece in your home, it adds lush greenery into your living room, bedroom, reading corner, or anywhere else! At the office, reception area, salon, showroom, photoshoot spot, or bistro the Monstera Deliciosa brings life and lushness where no other decor can. It’s also a perfect gift for those who love plants, tropical greenery, or unique accents. It's so versatile it suits all homes from modern minimalist to beach-style homes. Easy to care for. It goes without saying that you do not water or need to find a well-lit position, just the occasional dusting or wiping with a damp cloth. Satisfaction guarantee: At Botanica Greenery we aim to please! If the plant is not up to your satisfaction, please let us know so we can make things right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oEt4l4iGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Botanica Greenery","source_asin":"B07MXXY7CM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1166737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MXXY7CM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MXXY7CM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
